  - alternative 3' end
  - 3' UTR
  - direct RNA sequencing
  - nanopore
  - DEXSeq
  - stageR
abstract: >-
  Code, input data and a Docker environment that reproduce the analysis of
  differential poly(A) site usage between bloodstream and procyclic forms of
  Trypanosoma brucei from direct RNA nanopore sequencing, three replicates
  per stage: among 742 adequately measured genes, 52 show strong evidence of
  a different 3' end between the two stages.
